      "text": "# Amadeus — fully independent plugin. Own gateway, own port, own files.\n- insert:\n    - id: amadeus\n      name: dsh-amadeus\n      inject: [webServer, connection, tools, sessionQuery, sessionController, workspaceRegistry]\n      config:\n        setupFile: !!js dshHomePath('amadeus/setup.json')\n        stateFile: !!js dshHomePath('amadeus/devices.json')\n        controlFile: !!js dshHomePath('amadeus/control.json')\n        initiallyEnabled: false\n        listenHost: 127.0.0.1\n        listenPort: 3444\n        upstreamOrigin: http://127.0.0.1:3080\n        allowedCidrs: [127.0.0.0/8]\n        tls:\n          mode: disabled\n"
    }
